OL,3,GNEWSA'New school is putting children's
OL,4,Alives at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school forced to close twice
OL,7,Fsince being opened recently is "putting
OL,8,Flives at risk", concerned parents have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FLakenheath Community Primary School in
OL,12,FSuffolk welcomed pupils to its new,
OL,13,Flarger building on Station Road in
OL,14,FSeptember. It closed for a day just
OL,15,Fweeks later after the removal of a
OL,16,Fzebra crossing led to road safety
OL,17,Fconcerns, and again this week when a
OL,18,Ftemporary generator stopped working.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
