OL,3,GNEWSA'New school is putting children's
OL,4,Alives at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents said it was "not in a million
OL,7,Fyears" ready and its location near a
OL,8,F60mph road posed a danger, but it would
OL,9,Ftake "an accident or fatality" for
OL,10,Fanything to change.
OL,12,FSuffolk County Council said it had
OL,13,F"faced serious challenges" and was
OL,14,Fsorry that some parents were unhappy.
